{
	"character": "Miles",
	"voice": "am_liam",
	"speed": 1.05,
	"lines": {
		"Oh, thank God, a new face. I'm Miles. I make the books pretty; you make them make sense. Deal?": "miles-e4ac496735.mp3",
		"Fun fact: Blackwood has had the same October for three years. Great for my aesthetic. Terrible for my sinuses.": "miles-d3bfb024a8.mp3",
		"Arthur's idea of a staff party is a silent proofread. Bring snacks. Hide them.": "miles-d8f4681c80.mp3",
		"The printer is haunted. Not metaphorically. Kick it twice and apologise.": "miles-6a40a2a0b1.mp3",
		"I moved here from Brooklyn for the 'slower pace'. It's so slow the seasons gave up.": "miles-8f2eb6dfd6.mp3",
		"See? You laughed. I'm writing that down. Exhibit A.": "miles-2e9ecc9fce.mp3",
		"That smile is going straight in my portfolio.": "miles-c33be05241.mp3",
		"Tough crowd. Tough, tough crowd.": "miles-0c5f4cd169.mp3",
		"Careful. Keep talking like that and I'll redesign the whole catalogue in silver. To match the hair.": "miles-37c5c3826e.mp3",
		"So what does a woman like you do on a Friday, in a town with one bar and two churches?": "miles-23fac29b30.mp3",
		"I'm not flirting. I'm doing market research. On you.": "miles-87de55bddd.mp3",
		"You have real 'I could end a career with a red pen' energy. I'm into it. Professionally.": "miles-62abe0aaaf.mp3",
		"I'm going to pretend that was flirting. Let me have this.": "miles-06fd120709.mp3",
		"Okay, you have to stop being interesting. I have a deadline.": "miles-835ffda6ac.mp3",
		"Do you know how long I've waited for someone in this building to get my jokes?": "miles-92f25e607b.mp3",
		"Noted. Very loudly noted.": "miles-57ddcd44f0.mp3",
		"Okay, don't repeat this. His wife, Margaret? Healthy as a horse. Then sick like someone flipped a switch. Gone in a month.": "miles-f7b7a8c8ce.mp3",
		"Arthur used to be fun, believe it or not. He did voices at the Christmas party. Then Margaret got sick. Fast. Weird fast.": "miles-ca2c3117a8.mp3",
		"She kept saying she couldn't sleep. Bad dreams, she said. Then she stopped saying anything at all.": "miles-38f75be137.mp3",
		"Chloe thinks this town is cursed. Chloe thinks everything is cursed. But Chloe isn't always wrong.": "miles-230d052099.mp3",
		"I don't tell everyone this, you know. You've got a face people tell things to.": "miles-1a3a2d179a.mp3",
		"Forget I said anything.": "miles-e9eac0e0b7.mp3",
		"Message received. Colleagues. Excellent, professional colleagues.": "miles-fd522a484c.mp3",
		"Fair. Dialling it down to a respectful seven.": "miles-3443cc8ae2.mp3",
		"Got it. I'll go back to flirting with the font library.": "miles-8157d852ec.mp3",
		"Okay. Okay. I'm going.": "miles-d325ac7860.mp3",
		"Go, go. Welcome aboard, silver fox.": "miles-c2cd16c6e4.mp3",
		"Catch you tomorrow. Bring coffee and all is forgiven.": "miles-a9c102efb5.mp3",
		"Don't let Arthur keep you past six. He'll try. He thinks sunsets are optional.": "miles-3759e33b8f.mp3",
		"Tomorrow, then. I'll wear the good jacket.": "miles-2e6b502a06.mp3",
		"See you around.": "miles-b935664ace.mp3"
	}
}
